    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SAN FRANCISCO\nDonG KinGmfn\nDONG KINGMAN",
      "F\nSAN FRANCISCO\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nSAN FRANCISCO -the city on the bay, is a favorite of everyone. From Grant Avenue, in the heart of\nChinatown, with its Festivals, to Nob Hill, Fisherman's Wharf or the Golden Gate Bridge, there is so\nmuch to see. The quaint Cable Cars and other historical attractions blend with fine restaurants,\nelegant stores, and famous hotels such as Inter-Continental's renowned Mark Hopkins, to create a\nunique atmosphere. Pan Am serves San Francisco every day from New York, Houston, Miami,\nCentral and South America, Hawaii, Tokyo, Hong Kong, and London. In fact, you can get to\nSan Francisco on Pan Am from just about any place in the world\nPAN AM.\n2001.080.2118",
      "Cocktailo\nSherry Dubonnet Campari\nManhattan Gin Martini Vodka Martini Vermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka\nRum\nPremium Beer\nMenus\nAperitivo\nApéritif\nDelicias Culinarias\nSelected gourmet delicacies\nAsado del Día\nA selected cut of aged beef, roasted on board and carved to order.\nCostillas de Corderito a la Parrilla\nBroiled rib chops of spring lamb\nPechuga de Pollo a la Kiev\nTender breast of chicken with a savoury filling of\nsweet butter and fresh herbs.\nFilete de Congrio a la Molinera\nFresh fillet of Pacific Conger-eel sautéed with brown butter.\nlemon juice and parsley.\nPlato del Día\nToday's specilaity\nPapas a la Casera\nPotatoes Maison\nArroz Pilaf\nPilaf rice",
      "sweer ourer and mesh neros.\nFilete de Congrio a la Molinera\nFresh fillet of Pacific Conger-eel sautéed with brown butter.\nlemon juice and parsley.\nPlato del Dia\nToday's specilaity\nPapas a la Casera\nPotatoes Maison\nArroz Pilaf\nPilaf rice\nCate\nCoffee\nLegumbres en Mantequilla\nButtered vegetable bouquet\nEnsalada Campestre\nTossed garden salad\nSelección de Quesos y Frutas Frescas\nSelected fruits and cheeses\nPostre\nDessert\nCafé Descafeinado\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nTé\nTea\nSelected Red and White Wines\nChampagne Brut\nDrambuie Bénédictine Crème de Menthe\nCognac Napoléon Cointreau Kahlúa\nAmaretto di Saronno\n279 KS"
